  id: firstweapon
  displayName: Something to Fight With
  description: 'The weapon you came through with is one way to fight. Make a Knotted Club at the Workshop, from oak and nettle fibre: it stuns what it hits, which a blade doesn''t. Wear it in your weapon slot ({key:Character}) when you want a creature stopped rather than cut.'
  chain: The First Days
  journalNotes: 'Nettles grow at the clearing''s edge: pick them by hand for the fibre. Z swaps between the weapon in your hand and the one you held before it.'
